Package: diveMeta
Type: Package
Title: DiVE: Direct Variance Estimation for Meta-Analysis using Medians
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Tadahisa",
           family = "Okuda",
           email = "tadahisa.okuda@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut","cre"))
Description: Implements the DiVE method (Direct Variance Estimation) for pooling
    study-level effects when only medians and sample sizes are reported.
    Given per-study median differences and sample sizes, DiVE computes a pooled
    estimate, a directly estimated variance, and confidence intervals without
    requiring within-study variance estimates. The default CI uses a t critical
    value with df = N - 1.
